<div class="wrap"><div class="page-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Our approach</div><h1>Preparation should feel<br><span class="serif">possible.</span></h1><p class="lead">DualPath is being designed around a simple idea: students deserve a practical way to turn ambition into skills they can use.</p></div><div class="grid2"><div><h2 style="font-size:36px">A path to skills.<br>A path to opportunities.</h2><p class="muted">The two paths belong together. Learning matters most when you can apply it: a clear story about your work, a thoughtful conversation, a habit you can repeat.</p><p class="muted">We’re building around that connection, with structured lessons, practical assignments, and space to reflect on what comes next.</p><a class="text-link" href="/programmes">Explore the programme<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="card" style="background:#eef5ff"><div class="eyebrow">Principles, not promises</div><div class="timeline-step"><b><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg></b><div><h3>Useful over overwhelming</h3><p>One clear idea and a practical action at a time.</p></div></div><div class="timeline-step"><b><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg></b><div><h3>Evidence over appearances</h3><p>Progress comes from completed work and thoughtful reflection.</p></div></div><div class="timeline-step"><b><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg></b><div><h3>Support without shortcuts</h3><p>Feedback should help students improve their own thinking.</p></div></div></div></div></div>